-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §153 (part מו): the agreement sets anew the
-- pay and employment of teaching employees who moved to the reform; earlier
-- agreements, arrangements and written undertakings stay in force for its
-- term unless it amended or cancelled them, expressly or by implication;
-- and the salary-erosion comparison with the engineers does not apply to
-- employment under the reform.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `153`

-- (א) ¶1: an earlier term stays in force unless this agreement amended or
-- cancelled it, expressly or by implication.
@ref akn:art_153__para_a
GIVEN `amended or cancelled by this agreement` IS A BOOLEAN, `within this agreement's term` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an earlier term stays in force` `amended or cancelled by this agreement` `within this agreement's term` IF
    `within this agreement's term` AND NOT `amended or cancelled by this agreement`

-- akn:art_153__para_a/p2 The parties' undertaking to act in the spirit of (א) on questions the agreement did not discuss; no rule.

-- (ב): the erosion comparison with the engineers does not apply to
-- employment under the reform (¶2: of one in two schools, only to the
-- employment under the reform).
@ref akn:art_153__para_b akn:art_153__para_b/p2
GIVEN `the employment is under the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the erosion comparison applies to the employment` `the employment is under the reform` IF
    NOT `the employment is under the reform`

#ASSERT `an earlier term stays in force` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the erosion comparison applies to the employment` TRUE
